HzT-rpWYW2CUXLa5_fyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyISie2Sss07vBESElXflDFQAsUFxgOs9WF03jFlYHMMQ&oe=69C68178"}, "display_name": "Spatial Zombies Pro - Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["mixed", "reality", "zombies", "zombie", "survival"], "long_description": "#  THEY\u2019VE INVADED YOUR HOME.\nArm yourself with sleek pistols, precision rifles, or a devastating shotgun, and fight off relentless waves of undead in pulse-pounding battles. This is horror like you\u2019ve never experienced it before.\n\n{1933742264071420}\n\n# Your Space is the Battlefield!\nTurn your apartment, living room, or house into a zombie survival arena. Multi-room support means no corner is safe.\n\n{697527016635555}\n\n# One flashlight. No mercy. No escape.\nHorror Mode cranks the fear to the max. In this intense survival challenge, the atmosphere is darker, the tension higher, and the zombies more scary.\n\n{1158455589447771}\n\n# VR Levels: Escape Your World, Enter Theirs\nNeed a break from reality? Step fully into the undead apocalypse with our Full VR levels, designed for players who want a change of pace, or simply need a break from their playspace.\n\n\n**Spatial Zombies is available now in Early Access\u2014be among the first to experience the action and join a growing community of survivors.**", "short_description": "Spatial Zombies drops you into an intense Mixed Reality horror shooter where the undead invade your own home. \nFight through high-adrenaline battles with an explosive soundtrack, move freely with multi-room support, and switch to Horror Mode for a darker, more terrifying experience. \nAlso includes optional VR levels, perfect when your playspace isn't ready but the zombie horde still calls.\nGet ready, the horde is waiting, and your survival starts now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://forstech.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tom Foerster", "support_website_url